Left (red): `enum List { Cons(i32, List), Nil }` drawn as boxes nested inside each other, each labelled "Cons: i32 + a whole List inside", ending in "... forever". Caption: "size = ? (E0072)".

Right (green): `enum List { Cons(i32, Box<List>), Nil }`. On the stack, one fixed-size value "Cons 1 | ptr" (an i32 and one pointer, plus a tag). Its pointer arrows to a heap node "Cons 2 | ptr", which points to "Cons 3 | ptr", which points to "Nil".

