Subject: [PATCH] queue: block on semaphores instead of a condition variable

Two bugs come from wakeups the condition variable loses: the stall where
acquisition waits for space while the queue is empty, and the stop that
sometimes hangs until systemd kills us. A semaphore post is counted even
